marathon-agents
===============

This repository is a runnable reconstruction of the Google Codelab
"Build a Multi-Agent Marathon Planner with ADK and A2A" (Next '26 Developer
Keynote track):

  https://codelabs.developers.google.com/next26/dev-keynote/build-multi-agent-marathon-planner

Code samples from that codelab are licensed under the Apache License 2.0;
the codelab prose is licensed under CC BY 4.0. Copyright of the original
material belongs to Google LLC.

Files NOT present in the codelab and written for this repository (so that the
system actually runs end to end) are marked with a header comment reading
"NOT IN THE CODELAB". See docs/GOTCHAS.md for the full list and rationale.
